<title>FINLAND: Finnish July WPI rises 2.0 percent yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish July WPI rises 2.0 percent yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Finnish wholesale price index rose 0.6 percent in July on June and it rose 2.0 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>		 July 1997     June 1997     July 1996</p>
<p> Mth/mth	+0.6 pct	-0.2 pct	+0.4 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr	  +2.0 pct	+1.8 pct	+0.5 pct</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
